{"seq":2,"slug":"streaming-ssr-principles","title":"流式渲染原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-server-components-ssr/foundations/streaming-ssr-principles","wordCount":1452,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"流式渲染原理\">流式渲染原理</h1><p>传统 SSR 的致命缺陷在于原子性：服务器必须完成<strong>所有</strong>数据获取和<strong>整棵</strong>组件树的渲染，才能发送第一个字节到浏览器。流式渲染打破了这个原子性——它允许服务器在部分内容就绪时立即开始传输，同时继续处理剩余部分。这不是一个简单的性能优化，而是对&quot;服务端渲染&quot;这个概念的重新定义：从&quot;一次性生成完整文档&quot;变为&quot;持续生产内容片段的管道&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>流式渲染打破了传统 SSR 的原子性：Server 不再等所有数据和整棵组件树就绪才发送首字节，而是 Shell 就绪即开始传输，剩余内容由 Suspense 边界异步注入。它的传输基础是 HTTP 分块编码或 HTTP/2·3 的 stream；React 对应提供 <code>renderToPipeableStream</code>（Node.js）与 <code>renderToReadableStream</code>（Web Streams）两个语义等价的 API；Suspense 边界是流的切割点，服务端用 <code>&lt;template&gt;</code> 占位、数据就绪后以内联脚本替换。</p>\n<h2 id=\"http-传输层基础\">HTTP 传输层基础</h2><p>流式渲染的底层依赖是 HTTP 的分块传输编码（Chunked Transfer Encoding）。在 HTTP/1.1 中，服务器通过 <code>Transfer-Encoding: chunked</code> 头声明响应体将以多个块的形式发送，每个块前置其十六进制长度：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"HTTP/1.1 200 OK&#10;Transfer-Encoding: chunked&#10;Content-Type: text/html&#10;&#10;1a\\r\\n&#10;&lt;html&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;title&gt;App&lt;/title&gt;&#10;\\r\\n&#10;2f\\r\\n&#10;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;root&quot;&gt;&#10;\\r\\n&#10;...&#10;0\\r\\n&#10;\\r\\n\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>HTTP/1.1 200 OK</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Transfer-Encoding: chunked</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Content-Type: text/html</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>1a\\r\\n</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;html>&#x3C;head>&#x3C;title>App&#x3C;/title></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\\r\\n</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>2f\\r\\n</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;/head>&#x3C;body>&#x3C;div id=\"root\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\\r\\n</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>0\\r\\n</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\\r\\n</span></span></code></pre></div><p>HTTP/2 和 HTTP/3 天然支持流式传输——每个响应是一个 stream，数据帧（DATA frame）可以在 stream 内持续发送，直到设置 END_STREAM 标志。这消除了 HTTP/1.1 分块编码的解析开销，也允许服务端和客户端之间的多路复用。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>协议版本</th>\n<th>流式机制</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>限制</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>HTTP/1.1</td>\n<td>Chunked Transfer Encoding</td>\n<td>广泛支持</td>\n<td>队头阻塞、单连接单响应</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HTTP/2</td>\n<td>Stream + DATA Frames</td>\n<td>多路复用、无队头阻塞</td>\n<td>TCP 层队头阻塞</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HTTP/3 (QUIC)</td>\n<td>Stream + DATA Frames</td>\n<td>真正无队头阻塞</td>\n<td>生态成熟度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"react-流式渲染-api\">React 流式渲染 API</h2><p>React 18 引入了两个流式渲染 API，分别对应 Node.js 和 Web Streams 环境：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// Node.js 环境 — Pipeable Stream&#10;import { renderToPipeableStream } from &#39;react-dom/server&#39;;&#10;&#10;const { pipe, abort } = renderToPipeableStream(&lt;App /&gt;, {&#10;  bootstrapScripts: [&#39;/client.js&#39;],&#10;  onShellReady() {&#10;    // Shell 就绪：&lt;html&gt;、&lt;head&gt;、布局组件已渲染&#10;    response.statusCode = 200;&#10;    response.setHeader(&#39;Content-Type&#39;, &#39;text/html&#39;);&#10;    pipe(response);&#10;  },&#10;  onShellError(error) {&#10;    // Shell 渲染失败：降级为客户端渲染&#10;    response.statusCode = 500;&#10;    response.send(&#39;&lt;html&gt;&lt;body&gt;Loading...&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;&#39;);&#10;  },&#10;  onAllReady() {&#10;    // 所有内容（包括 Suspense 内部）渲染完成&#10;    // 用于爬虫：等所有内容就绪再发送&#10;  },&#10;  onError(error) {&#10;    console.error(error);&#10;  }&#10;});&#10;&#10;// 设置超时：防止无限等待&#10;setTimeout(abort, 10000);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Node.js 环境 — Pipeable Stream</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { renderToPipeableStream } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'react-dom/server'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">pipe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">abort</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> renderToPipeableStream</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">App</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> />, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  bootstrapScripts: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/client.js'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  onShellReady</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // Shell 就绪：&#x3C;html>、&#x3C;head>、布局组件已渲染</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    response.statusCode </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    response.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setHeader</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Content-Type'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'text/html'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    pipe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(response);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  onShellError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // Shell 渲染失败：降级为客户端渲染</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    response.statusCode </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 500</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    response.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">send</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'&#x3C;html>&#x3C;body>Loading...&#x3C;/body>&#x3C;/html>'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  onAllReady</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 所有内容（包括 Suspense 内部）渲染完成</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 用于爬虫：等所有内容就绪再发送</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  onError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(error);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 设置超时：防止无限等待</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setTimeout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(abort, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// Edge/Web Streams 环境 — Readable Stream&#10;import { renderToReadableStream } from &#39;react-dom/server&#39;;&#10;&#10;const stream = await renderToReadableStream(&lt;App /&gt;, {&#10;  bootstrapScripts: [&#39;/client.js&#39;],&#10;  signal: AbortSignal.timeout(10000),&#10;});&#10;&#10;return new Response(stream, {&#10;  headers: { &#39;Content-Type&#39;: &#39;text/html&#39; },&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Edge/Web Streams 环境 — Readable Stream</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { renderToReadableStream } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'react-dom/server'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> stream</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> renderToReadableStream</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">App</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> />, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  bootstrapScripts: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/client.js'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  signal: AbortSignal.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">timeout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Response</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(stream, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  headers: { </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Content-Type'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'text/html'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p>两个 API 的行为语义相同，区别仅在于适配的 I/O 模型。<code>renderToPipeableStream</code> 使用 Node.js 的 pipe 模式，<code>renderToReadableStream</code> 返回 WHATWG ReadableStream。</p>\n<h2 id=\"suspense-边界-流的切割点\">Suspense 边界：流的切割点</h2><p>Suspense 组件是流式渲染的核心控制原语。它告诉 React：&quot;这个子树可能还没准备好，先发送 fallback，稍后再注入真实内容。&quot;</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph HTML 流的时间线&#10;        T1[&quot;t=0ms: Shell HTML 发送&quot;] --&gt; T2[&quot;t=50ms: Header + Nav 已可见&quot;]&#10;        T2 --&gt; T3[&quot;t=200ms: ProductInfo 数据就绪&quot;]&#10;        T3 --&gt; T4[&quot;t=200ms: 注入 ProductInfo HTML&quot;]&#10;        T4 --&gt; T5[&quot;t=500ms: Reviews 数据就绪&quot;]&#10;        T5 --&gt; T6[&quot;t=500ms: 注入 Reviews HTML&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph HTML 流的时间线\n        T1[\"t=0ms: Shell HTML 发送\"] --&gt; T2[\"t=50ms: Header + Nav 已可见\"]\n        T2 --&gt; T3[\"t=200ms: ProductInfo 数据就绪\"]\n        T3 --&gt; T4[\"t=200ms: 注入 ProductInfo HTML\"]\n        T4 --&gt; T5[\"t=500ms: Reviews 数据就绪\"]\n        T5 --&gt; T6[\"t=500ms: 注入 Reviews HTML\"]\n    end</pre><p>流式注入的具体机制是：React 在初始 HTML 中为每个未就绪的 Suspense 边界生成一个带 <code>id</code> 的占位符（通常是 <code>&lt;template&gt;</code> 标签），然后在数据就绪后，通过一个内联 <code>&lt;script&gt;</code> 标签将真实 HTML 替换进去：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"html\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- 初始发送的 Shell --&gt;&#10;&lt;div id=&quot;root&quot;&gt;&#10;  &lt;header&gt;...&lt;/header&gt;&#10;  &lt;main&gt;&#10;    &lt;!--$?--&gt;&#10;    &lt;template id=&quot;B:0&quot;&gt;&lt;/template&gt;&#10;    &lt;div class=&quot;skeleton&quot;&gt;Loading...&lt;/div&gt;&#10;    &lt;!--/$--&gt;&#10;  &lt;/main&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;!-- 数据就绪后追加的 chunk --&gt;&#10;&lt;div hidden id=&quot;S:0&quot;&gt;&#10;  &lt;section class=&quot;product-info&quot;&gt;&#10;    &lt;h1&gt;产品名称&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;产品描述...&lt;/p&gt;&#10;  &lt;/section&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;script&gt;&#10;  // React 的内部替换逻辑（简化表示）&#10;  $RC(&#39;B:0&#39;, &#39;S:0&#39;);&#10;&lt;/script&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- 初始发送的 Shell --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"root\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">header</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>...&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">header</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span st