an><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">amin</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2935em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>F</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{FCP}^{streaming} = T_{TTFB}^{streaming} + T_{parse}^{shell}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2361em;vertical-align:-0.2935em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9426em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4065em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">amin</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2935em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2361em;vertical-align:-0.2935em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9426em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4065em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">amin</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2935em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2822em;vertical-align:-0.3831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>流式渲染将 TTFB 与数据获取<strong>解耦</strong>：Shell（通常是布局、导航、骨架屏）不依赖任何异步数据，可以立即渲染并发送。后续的动态内容通过 Suspense 边界异步注入，每个边界独立解析、独立展示。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>传统 SSR</th>\n<th>流式 SSR</th>\n<th>改善幅度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>TTFB</td>\n<td>受最慢数据源制约</td>\n<td>仅取决于 Shell 复杂度</td>\n<td>60-90% 降低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FCP</td>\n<td>= TTFB + 解析时间</td>\n<td>Shell 发送即可见</td>\n<td>50-80% 降低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LCP</td>\n<td>= FCP（所有内容同时出现）</td>\n<td>取决于关键内容的数据延迟</td>\n<td>30-50% 降低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TTI</td>\n<td>取决于 JS bundle 大小</td>\n<td>选择性水合分摊成本</td>\n<td>见水合策略篇</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"流的背压与错误处理\">流的背压与错误处理</h2><p>流式渲染引入了传统渲染不存在的工程问题——<strong>背压（backpressure）</strong>。当服务器生产 HTML 块的速度超过网络传输速度时，流需要暂停生产以避免内存溢出。Node.js 的 pipe 机制天然处理背压：当下游 <code>writable</code> 的内部缓冲区满时，<code>readable.pipe()</code> 会暂停读取。</p>\n<p>错误处理在流式场景下更加复杂：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[组件渲染出错] --&gt; B{错误发生时机}&#10;    B --&gt;|Shell 渲染阶段| C[onShellError: 降级为 CSR]&#10;    B --&gt;|Suspense 内部| D[最近的 Error Boundary 捕获]&#10;    B --&gt;|所有 Suspense 都失败| E[整个 Suspense 区域显示 Error Boundary fallback]&#10;    D --&gt; F[Error Boundary fallback 注入流中]\">graph TD\n    A[组件渲染出错] --&gt; B{错误发生时机}\n    B --&gt;|Shell 渲染阶段| C[onShellError: 降级为 CSR]\n    B --&gt;|Suspense 内部| D[最近的 Error Boundary 捕获]\n    B --&gt;|所有 Suspense 都失败| E[整个 Suspense 区域显示 Error Boundary fallback]\n    D --&gt; F[Error Boundary fallback 注入流中]</pre><p>关键原则：Shell 阶段的错误是灾难性的（整个页面无法渲染），必须有降级策略。Suspense 内部的错误是局部的——React 会在流中注入 Error Boundary 的 fallback，不影响已发送的其他区域。</p>\n<h2 id=\"生产环境的流控制策略\">生产环境的流控制策略</h2><p>在 Next.js 16 中，流式渲染的行为通过多层配置控制：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Shell 就绪即发送</strong>：默认行为。布局和非 Suspense 包裹的内容就绪后立即开始流式传输</li>\n<li><strong>爬虫模式</strong>：检测到 Googlebot 等爬虫时（通过 User-Agent），等待 <code>onAllReady</code> 后一次性发送完整 HTML</li>\n<li><strong>超时控制</strong>：通过 <code>AbortSignal.timeout()</code> 设置最大等待时间。超时后未完成的 Suspense 边界发送 fallback</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// Next.js 16 的 after() API — 响应发送后执行后续工作&#10;import { after } from &#39;next/server&#39;;&#10;&#10;export default async function Page() {&#10;  after(() =&gt; {&#10;    // 这段代码在响应流关闭后执行&#10;    // 用于日志记录、缓存预热、分析上报&#10;    analytics.track(&#39;page_viewed&#39;, { path: &#39;/product&#39; });&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  return &lt;ProductPage /&gt;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Next.js 16 的 after() API — 响应发送后执行后续工作</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { after } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'next/server'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Page</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  after</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 这段代码在响应流关闭后执行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 用于日志记录、缓存预热、分析上报</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    analytics.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">track</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'page_viewed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { path: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/product'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ProductPage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> />;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>流式渲染把&quot;一次性生成完整文档&quot;变成&quot;持续生产内容片段的管道&quot;，将 TTFB 与数据获取解耦</li>\n<li>传输基础是 HTTP/1.1 chunked 编码与 HTTP/2·3 的 stream，后者消除了分块解析开销</li>\n<li><code>renderToPipeableStream</code> 与 <code>renderToReadableStream</code> 行为语义相同，仅适配的 I/O 模型不同</li>\n<li>Suspense 边界是流的切割点：未就绪先发 fallback，就绪后由 <code>$RC</code> 脚本替换占位模板</li>\n<li>Shell 阶段错误需降级策略（<code>onShellError</code> → CSR），Suspense 内错误由最近的 Error Boundary 局部捕获</li>\n<li>背压由 Node.js pipe 天然处理；生产环境通过爬虫模式、超时控制、<code>after()</code> 调控流行为</li>\n</ul>\n<p>流式渲染将&quot;服务端渲染&quot;从一个原子操作变成了一个管道（pipeline）。下一篇 <a href=\"hydration-strategies\">水合策略与选择性水合</a> 将讨论这个管道的终点——当 HTML 流到达浏览器后，如何高效地将静态 DOM 激活为可交互应用。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"流式渲染原理","id":"流式渲染原理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"HTTP 传输层基础","id":"http-传输层基础"},{"level":2,"text":"React 流式渲染 API","id":"react-流式渲染-api"},{"level":2,"text":"Suspense 边界：流的切割点","id":"suspense-边界-流的切割点"},{"level":2,"text":"流式渲染的时间模型","id":"流式渲染的时间模型"},{"level":2,"text":"流的背压与错误处理","id":"流的背压与错误处理"},{"level":2,"text":"生产环境的流控制策略","id":"生产环境的流控制策略"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"SSR 演进与架构变迁","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-server-components-ssr/foundations/ssr-evolution-history"},"next":{"title":"水合策略与选择性水合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-server-components-ssr/foundations/hydration-strategies"}}